 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Wrap the beef in cling film and freeze for <b>1–2 hours</b>, until firm on the outside but still possible to cut with a knife.</li><li>Find which way the fibres run. Cut <b>across the grain</b> into slices <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"2\" data-b=\"3\" data-s=\"0\">2–3 mm</span> thick</b>, holding the beef with a claw grip. Cut long slices in half to about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"6\" data-s=\"0\">6 cm</span>.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
