     "name_html": "Beef sirloin or ribeye, in one piece"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Grate the pear on the fine side of the grater and mince the garlic. Stir in the soy sauce, sugar, honey, ginger, mirin, sesame oil and pepper.</li><li>Cut the ends off the onion, halve it and slice it lengthwise. Massage the marinade into the beef with your hands, mix in the onion and leave for <b>30 minutes</b>, or covered in the fridge overnight.</li></ul>",
