  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat the empty steel pan on <b>high</b> for about 2 minutes, until a drop of water rolls around as a ball. Add the oil.</li><li>Lift a third of the beef out of the marinade and spread it in <b>one layer</b>. Leave it for <b>1 minute</b> to brown, then toss for another <b>1 minute</b> until just cooked. Move it to a plate and repeat. A crowded pan fills with liquid and the beef boils instead of searing.</li></ul>",
