  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Return all the beef to the pan with the spring onions and any marinade left in the bowl. Toss for <b>1 minute</b>, until the sauce turns glossy and coats the meat.</li><li>Scatter with sesame seeds. Serve with rice, and lettuce leaves to wrap if you like.</li></ul>",
